  "scenes": {
    "research": "<div class=\"research-scene\">\n <div><div class=\"mimo-meta\" lang=\"en\">01 / RESEARCH · EDITORIAL</div>\n <h3 class=\"mimo-display\" data-edit-id=\"research-title\" lang=\"zh-CN\">让复杂的想法，<br>有清晰的去向。</h3>\n <p class=\"mimo-body\" data-edit-id=\"research-body\" lang=\"zh-CN\">研究值得被认真阅读，而不是被过度包装。以论点、证据和下一步构成阅读路径。</p>\n <div class=\"byline\"><strong>03</strong><div class=\"mimo-meta\" lang=\"en\">QUESTION → EVIDENCE → INSIGHT<br>ILLUSTRATIVE, NOT EXPERIMENTAL DATA</div></div></div>\n <div><figure class=\"research-figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"原创示意：三步之间通过路径连接，不表示真实研究数据\">\n <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--mimo-rule)\"><path d=\"M30 45H570M30 105H570M30 165H570M100 25V190M300 25V190M500 25V190\"/></g>\n <path d=\"M60 165C160 165 166 48 300 70S413 164 540 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--mimo-accent)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n <g fill=\"var(--mimo-canvas)\" stroke=\"var(--mimo-accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"165\" r=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"70\" r=\"7\"/><circle cx=\"540\" cy=\"50\" r=\"7\"/></g>\n <g fill=\"var(--mimo-muted)\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"12\"><text x=\"44\" y=\"206\">01</text><text x=\"285\" y=\"206\">02</text><text x=\"523\" y=\"206\">03</text></g></svg><figcaption>FIG. 01 / 把关系画出来，而不是添加无关装饰。</figcaption></figure>\n <a class=\"mimo-index-row\" href=\"#principles\"><span class=\"index\">01</span><span class=\"title\" data-edit-id=\"research-row1\" lang=\"zh-CN\">提出值得回答的问题</span><span class=\"mimo-icon-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n <a class=\"mimo-index-row\" href=\"#foundations\"><span class=\"index\">02</span><span class=\"title\" data-edit-id=\"research-row2\" lang=\"zh-CN\">让证据承载视觉重点</span><span class=\"mimo-icon-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n <a class=\"mimo-index-row\" href=\"#motion\"><span class=\"index\">03</span><span class=\"title\" data-edit-id=\"research-row3\" lang=\"zh-CN\">用运动解释新的联系</span><span class=\"mimo-icon-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n </div></div>",
    "developer": "<div class=\"developer-scene\"><div><div class=\"mimo-meta\" lang=\"en\">02 / DEVELOPER · HUMANIST</div>\n <h3 class=\"mimo-display\" data-edit-id=\"developer-title\" lang=\"zh-CN\">少一点干扰。<br>多一点创造。</h3>\n <p class=\"mimo-body\" data-edit-id=\"developer-body\" lang=\"zh-CN\">让命令、代码和工作状态本身成为设计。熟悉的工程语言，配上清晰而温和的界面。</p>\n <div class=\"mimo-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"命令示例平台\"><button role=\"tab\" id=\"platform-python\" aria-controls=\"command-example\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" data-platform=\"python\">Python</button><button role=\"tab\" id=\"platform-node\" aria-controls=\"command-example\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-platform=\"node\">Node.js</button></div>\n <div class=\"mimo-command\" id=\"command-example\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"platform-python\"><code id=\"copy-command\">python --version</code><button class=\"mimo-button secondary\" id=\"copy-command-button\" type=\"button\">复制 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div>\n <p class=\"notes-line\">示例命令只复制，不执行。复制成功与失败会分别反馈。</p>\n <div class=\"dev-files\"><span>01 / tokens.css</span><span>02 / mimo.css</span><span>03 / motion.js</span></div></div>\n <div><div class=\"terminal\"><div class=\"terminal-head\"><span>FIELD / LOCAL SPECIMEN</span><span>READ-ONLY</span></div>\n <pre><code><span style=\"opacity:.65\">$ inspect design-language</span>\n\n<span class=\"terminal-lines\" data-edit-id=\"developer-terminal\" lang=\"en\">Identity       clear + capable + human\nBranches       rational / dark\nLayout         open canvas\nMotion         meaning before spectacle</span>\n\n<span style=\"opacity:.7\">✓ semantic styles\n✓ editable structure\n✓ self-contained resources</span>\n\n&gt; ready for your next idea<span aria-hidden=\"true\">_</span></code></pre>\n <div class=\"terminal-footer\"><span>LOCAL VISUAL DEMO</span><span>NO COMMAND EXECUTED</span></div></div><p class=\"notes-line\" style=\"margin-top:28px\">可复用的是工具的直接性，不是某个产品的商标或界面截图。</p></div></div>",
    "workspace": "<div class=\"workspace-scene\"><aside class=\"workspace-nav\" aria-label=\"工作区示例导航\"><div class=\"wsbrand\">Field workspace</div><button type=\"button\" data-workspace-nav=\"compose\" aria-pressed=\"true\">＋ 开始任务</button><button type=\"button\" data-workspace-nav=\"files\" aria-pressed=\"false\">▱ 项目资料</button><button type=\"button\" data-workspace-nav=\"history\" aria-pressed=\"false\">↺ 最近活动</button><div class=\"meta\">个人工具场景<br>LOCAL INTERACTION<br>NO MODEL CONNECTED</div></aside>\n <div class=\"workspace-main\"><div class=\"mimo-meta\" lang=\"en\">03 / WORKSPACE · FOCUS</div>\n <h3 class=\"\" data-edit-id=\"workspace-title\" lang=\"zh-CN\">把注意力，留给真正的工作。</h3>\n <p class=\"mimo-body\" data-edit-id=\"workspace-body\" lang=\"zh-CN\">输入、执行、反馈与成果保持相邻。界面安静地退后，人的意图向前。</p>\n <div id=\"workspace-compose\"><div class=\"mimo-composer\"><label class=\"mimo-sr\" for=\"task-input\">描述任务，运行的是本地状态演示</label><textarea id=\"task-input\" placeholder=\"例如：为一份研究报告梳理信息层级…\">为这份设计语言整理一个三步使用纲要。</textarea><div class=\"tools\"><span class=\"mimo-meta\">本地交互演示 · 不调用 AI</span><button id=\"task-run\" class=\"mimo-button\" type=\"button\">开始演示 <span class=\"mimo-icon-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></div>\n <div class=\"suggestions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mimo-button secondary\" data-prompt=\"把长篇技术内容组织成清晰的阅读层级。\">阅读层级</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mimo-button secondary\" data-prompt=\"用一段有意义的动效解释两个对象的关系。\">关系动效</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mimo-button secondary\" id=\"task-cancel\" disabled>取消演示</button></div>\n <div class=\"task-panel\" id=\"task-panel\"><div class=\"mimo-meta\" id=\"task-status\" role=\"status\">就绪 · 等待你的操作</div><div class=\"task-steps\"><span data-step=\"0\">01 理解意图</span><span data-step=\"1\">02 建立结构</span><span data-step=\"2\">03 呈现结果</span></div><div class=\"mimo-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"本地示例步骤进度\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"3\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" id=\"task-progress\"><i style=\"width:0%\"></i></div><div class=\"task-output\" id=\"task-output\"></div></div></div>\n <div id=\"workspace-files\" hidden class=\"blank-diagnostic\"><p>示例项目资源</p><div class=\"mimo-meta\">design-language.json<br>motion-resources.json<br>AI_CONTEXT.md</div><p class=\"state-explanation\">此列表用于展示信息组织，不代表读取了你的电脑文件。</p></div>\n <div id=\"workspace-history\" hidden class=\"blank-diagnostic\"><p>还没有运行记录。</p><p class=\"state-explanation\">此样例不保存会话日志。开始任务后，可在任务区域观察实时状态。</p></div>\n </div></div>"
